# ============================================================================
# SoyMutDB Genome Browser (apps/jbrowse) — Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# SPA fallback: any request that does NOT match a real static file is served
# index.html so client-side routes (deep links, session params) work with a
# hard reload. Real static files (index.html, /assets/* hashed files) are
# served before this catch-all — mirrors Pages' built-in SPA behavior when
# no top-level 404.html exists. Verified post-deploy with:
#   curl -sI https://<site>/assets/<hash>.js (expect 200, immutable cache)
#   curl -sI https://<site>/some/spa/deep/link  (expect 200, index.html)
# ============================================================================
/* /index.html 200
